///
/// Specify null to remove the decoration entirely (including the
/// extra padding introduced by the decoration to save space for the labels).␀¿␀DY¿␀D_6/// {@macro flutter.widgets.editableText.keyboardType}␀¿␀DpÅ=¿␀EûÅ
